        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Use of IP access network, shares per hour
The data set represents the mix of fixed and wireless network in Switzerland; UUID: e16d1e0b-e218-338f-9522-16553e1c97d4
The datasets represents the access network of Switzerland for the year 2020. The total amount of network traffic is based on information from the ITU report. The functional unit = 1 GB.
Location: Data for Swiss networks
Technology: The mix of Swiss access transmission network.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e16d1e0b-e218-338f-9522-16553e1c97d4.xml</text>
